{"generated": "2026-07-29 19:42", "curation": {"market": "개인 투자자 여러분, 안녕하십니까. 지난 24시간 동안 시장을 뒤흔든 주요 이슈들을 정리해 드립니다.\n\n<b>1. 국내 증시, 사상 초유의 폭락과 금융 당국의 대응</b>\n국내 증시는 이틀 연속 코스피와 코스닥 양 시장에서 서킷 브레이커가 발동되는 사상 초유의 폭락을 경험했습니다. 이틀간 10%대 폭락을 기록하며 수천조 원의 시가총액이 증발했고, 개인 투자자들의 투매가 이어졌습니다. 금융 당국 수장들은 시장 변동성에 대해 \"매우 무거운 책임감을 느낀다\"고 밝히며 상황을 예의주시하고 있습니다. [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE41dUU5Y1BuaUFDSDBZdGhyU09CbUxSQ1dmdXBENnB6OExLdGJCaElNdkdDS3FtU0Z6UzJzRWlSR0FLYWxRS19XbTZfYWVtSmM?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1Ga2N4dENhZ3k3MVNud3FCWE51SG8xRmhqN1E5NlpNRENQbnJvQVNBX1BZU0RwR0Utc0dnQW1aUFZjWGRCMkVYVlN1NndDQ2pXbnc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#6</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE45akpZRmRXMjEwV2Zmelo1VzRSX3Y4OXlWYmY5d1dOdENwRGQ0R1VZYzNoTXZjeldaMXd2NGdVUzhkQjdzM1dMU2tMRDZ2VEU3ejFUTWQ2YWkybTNobDRyZl9iTXpMeXk3Snc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1nVG9JcmJmUFJZNVRkVGsyLWlhbVFWaVNrajFOTVloX1k5Z1VNQXhMWlZhbXFValRIQXdNUWZxai1mZGV0REVGbzl6ZkUtb0xWYjN2VjlpWXd1ams?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFBtWjlfaVFGUUtwWjNFTjJzbWM3VUNOWXZxVmhzYVZjamZ3bzQ1dkN5RkVWSnppRFktelVnVnNrUTZ1V0sta3U1M19mZjF4ZVo4STJKN0FxUmhHQmdfaE52MEJnV0ExX19l?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9JQUN4MFktV2xiLVlEN3J4THh6T3dMc1hTVE9wN21UZndWMi1feno5bzVPYUZNWTBzdVYwUm5sdTNjdlRUTnNkUkpLcWhPRlJ1U3p5dG9SSHZ6czlzTXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9wZWU3X09hVWF3dUtlZ3hfeWhabHQ0NnhmalNfQnhCeWtrNjJwUnVkMkxfTWkwcjJzOGYzejJQbXlJTkkxSHlLZXozOWFoVU5LOGNQdi1PNzc4OVnSAWBBVV95cUxPdl9yek45RlYwcGp0alJnYUVLeG9xekRXRUp5WTNyRDRSZzRoWmdJMms2YTI0LWZkbndrbzEwREhNZGtvVTR5NWVXblNJRGplak5zWXdaNldVTXA