결론 우세 속 인상 가능성도 제기</b>\n미국 연방공개시장위원회(FOMC)의 7월 금리 결정이 임박했습니다. 시장에서는 금리 동결론이 우세하지만, 일부에서는 깜짝 금리 인상 가능성도 제기되며 채권 시장에 긴장감을 불어넣고 있습니다. 연준의 결정은 메타, 마이크로소프트 등 주요 기업들의 실적 발표와 함께 시장의 주요 관전 포인트가 될 것입니다. [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE5LazEyemk1N1RscFRjY1czaTRaelRSUmdvc3I0Vkxyc3U1aXhGTjlUWWtBcC01ZFVOelZLOF9nZWszVXRIQjNOcDJ1TUJUMlYweXpnSTdxNnRNVVdBZFBockhKRQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#7</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5ySXVYQzNWcTl0R1QyUTJZVXBBcXM5d0ZKV2k2TGU4ODlCTkZzMXY1UHpVVUZ2aWk5TGtiQTlaQUJQc0Z1bnRuZlVuYWVVOWxGdHdwR2Q1UXlHMkluRlBadFRjT3pYX2l1VEE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5yWVJqRlo5LTRHYWR3ZXBDZmh4TWhSZUdpcWt2RGJxN1lNUWhKVndWc1NwWktIRkFHdmlPejNpMmE4XzdHaHg4OWpLSDNRUWtFMnJpbkpQQXp6WUVUUjdEaG55QjJBdmFHb2hmYXFDbVN0Zw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE52dUVQQ2tPU2NZV0JjbzE0NWZMcTFtTV8wYUpyamd3M2tBVE9BbGs5NWZOYXJJTHVCeF82VFhyeEs2Rk1rYjNhMTJ1WVV6SmNSU1Q2WEJUaE9IZXZudG9rcdIBZkFVX3lxTE1SaXFOUEZjMXAtb2xHMEp2VFdLckdvUTRMNEFkMXJCZndRRzR0MjFhRl9Uck90NzJiVFRtVkZVQ09lMEdlYmFUQ044V05pd0hjNGpqclA0LXVYa2U4UDN2Y0l3T1d5dw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE9JWXVfRXBOX1FmVjVuLUZOaWs4cFQtdy03SWlJUVpoT25sUllNSGhWT1gteDhySzAtZ290cGVBNHVydHlMWGtHZHU3cmFWYUF2bDNvMS0tVDlIU0lxSVJFV09UeWdEWk0?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFB6U3dDdERxUlF3QlRaWlhzak1GWUJqYnIyOFczeDBWOVpORHY3dnZ6VnVIZVZpOF9JbFM1R1gtUUgyazhnbENtQ1NkT0hLQjBhVkZOVWZpZjVscmho?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE9USEJjRDE1eUtlTEpUdEVuQ1RwaFJTTXYxenhrc3VCY1RoekNra2JQSlpnQ0hucjcwbEFUOVBzMllQNzc5RHdzdT